    <cap:headline>Heavy Rainfall</cap:headline>
    <cap:description>Heavy to Very Heavy Rainfall very likely at a few places with Extremely Heavy Falls at isolated places over Coastal Karnataka, South
Interior Karnataka, Lakshadweep and Kerala, Mahe; Heavy to very heavy rainfall with extremely heavy falls likely at isolated places over Tamil
Nadu, Puducherry, Karaikal.</cap:description>
    <cap:instruction>Action suggested:
•	Avoid going to areas that face the water logging problems often.
•	Avoid staying in vulnerable structure.
•	Check for traffic congestion on your route before journey.</cap:instruction>
